<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1954</h1><p class="ref-lede">1954 in world history: 36 events, 11 births, 14 deaths, 3 works, 1 state founded and 6 that came to an end. 367 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
